  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the given figure, two wheels <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>&nbsp;are connected by a belt <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>. The radius of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> is three times&nbsp;that of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>. In the case of the same rotational kinetic energy, the ratio of rotational inertias <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo></math> The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> will be ______.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/da73d93b-d7f3-4c43-825f-2bd297ac2f20-image.png\" style=\"width: 348px; height: 155px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
